  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exit of National Tuberculosis Program of Turkmenistan from the Global Fund - Turkmenistan (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkmenistan, Tuberculosis, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Turkmenistan)This program has the following goals: To reach the sustainability and self -reliance of the National TB Program of Turkmenistan by 2027 through the finalization of the transition from the Global Fund investments to the financing from the country sources. The objectives of this program are: To sustain universal access to quality and people -centered DS and DR-TB diagnosis, treatment, prevention and M&amp;E.  To sustain the National TB response in the complete transition to domestic funding</narrative>
  </description>
